The storm reaches the island. Shutters bang against the stone walls and the lamp room fills with salt spray. Mara braces the door with a chair. Theo drags the generator cable across the floor while the needle on the pressure gauge keeps falling. The lamp sputters. Somewhere below them, glass breaks and the whole tower seems to lean into the wind. Neither of them says a word.
